    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "What is the format of the tournament?",
        "answer": "We play a Scramble format to keep the pace fun and inclusive for all skill levels. Team up and bring your best!",
        "order": 0
      },
      {
        "question": "Where is the event being held?",
        "answer": "The Club at Weston Hills, Weston, Florida, located at 2600 Country Club Way, Weston, FL 33332. Complimentary parking is available onsite, and signage will guide you to registration.",
        "order": 1
      },
      {
        "question": "Are donations tax-deductible?",
        "answer": "Yes. Victoria Venezuela Foundation is a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization. Tax ID: 88-3282100. Contributions are tax-deductible under Internal Revenue Code Section 501(c)(3).",
        "order": 2
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I donate an item or service for the raffle or auction?",
        "answer": "Yes, and we deeply appreciate your support! Donating an item or service is a powerful way to contribute to our mission while showcasing your brand or talents to a passionate and engaged audience. We welcome a wide range of contributions, including:Gift baskets (gourmet foods, spa items, themed collections)Experiences (golf outings, weekend getaways, dining packages)Professional services (photography sessions, wellness consultations, coaching)Unique items (artwork, memorabilia, handcrafted goods)To donate, email us at charitygolf@victoriavenezuelafoundation.org with a brief description of the item or service, its estimated fair market value, and your contact information and business name (if applicable).",
        "order": 3
      }
    ],
